.TH node_query6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B node_query6

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
node_query6 interface target

Sends an ICMPv6 node query request to the target and dumps the replies.

